# SkinMapLocal

`SkinMapLocal` 是从 `FaceReconstructionLocal` 拆出的独立红区/棕区项目。它不包含
FLAME、Open3D、RGB-D、OBJ/GLB 或其他 3D 代码。

## 工程目标

- `skinmap_core`：公共 C++ 算法与厂家适配库。
- `skinmap_service.exe`：异步本地 HTTP 服务。
- `skin_map_rgb.exe`：单 RGB CLI。
- `skin_map_instrument.exe`：厂家多光谱 CLI。
- `skin_map_calibrate.exe`：RGB 风格标定工具。
- `skinmap_tests.exe`：独立测试及可选真人黄金回归。

当前提供纯 C++/OpenCV 的单张 RGB 视觉近似：

```powershell
cmake -S . -B build -A x64
cmake --build build --config Release --target skin_map_rgb
build\Release\skin_map_rgb.exe `
  --image "手机白光照片.jpg" `
  --device-profile generic `
  --output "result"
```

结果用于仪器风格展示，不等同于 CP/365 多光谱测量：

```json
{
  "measurement_grade": false,
  "diagnostic_grade": false
}
```

厂家多光谱 exact 路线要求 RGB、CP、365 三视角共 9 图；PP 三视角为可选
采集信息，不参与当前已确认的厂家 `/generate` 和 `/detect` 算法：

```powershell
build\Release\skin_map_instrument.exe `
  --input-dir "完整9图或12图目录" `
  --vendor-engine "..\Engine" `
  --output "instrument-result"
```

缺少任何 RGB、CP 或 365 图片会返回 `MISSING_MODALITY`。PP 可以提供 0–3 张；
只提供 1–2 张时任务继续执行并记录 `PARTIAL_PP_CAPTURE`。程序只会关闭由它自己
启动的 `XingerEngine.exe`，不会终止用户预先启动的厂家服务。

Exact 任务除 9 张 RED/BROWN/REDNE 外，还输出：

- `vendor_response.json`：厂家响应原样语义归档。
- `analysis.json`：`skin-analysis/1.0` 标准化的 25 项检测结果。
- 厂家 `output_imgs` 中所有安全的原始标注层，标记为 `raw_overlay`，不会被改写或
  冒充成品图。厂家当前样本同时存在RGBA透明层和三通道黑底稀疏层，两种编码都会
  原样保存并在artifact元数据中注明。
- 每个 L/M/R 标注层叠加到对应 `RGB_L/M/R.jpg` 后生成最长边 1600、JPEG 95
  的 `*_preview.jpg`；预览标记为默认用户视图，并与原始检测层（透明或三通道黑底
  标注层）显式配对。
- `RESULT_INDEX.html`：可离线打开的 25 项中英文结果索引；含等级、计数和预览，
  没有图像的检测项明确标记为 `JSON-only`。
- 可选红斑/色素派生掩码；对应增强图缺失时仅告警，不伪造图片。

厂家响应还必须满足业务层 `status == 200`，且 `data` 至少包含一个已知检测字段；
HTTP 200 但业务失败或空检测数据会被拒绝。厂家增强图发布前会实际解码校验，并受
32 MiB 单文件、256 MiB 单任务及 1 亿像素单图上限保护。

25 项检测包括肤质、痤疮、色素、红斑血管和眼周皱纹五组；其中 8 项为厂家
真实返回但当前前端隐藏的 `supported_hidden`。另有 6 项只存在配置或权重证据，
仅在能力清单中标记为 `experimental_unverified`。

异步 HTTP 服务默认只监听 `127.0.0.1:8765`：

```powershell
build\Release\skinmap_service.exe --root .
```
```

发布目录为 `SkinMapLocal-dist`。发布包不包含厂家Engine和真人数据。

### 6.4 配置厂家Engine的ASCII路径

厂家MediaPipe资源加载对中文路径存在兼容风险。推荐建立ASCII目录联接：

```powershell
Set-Location "D:\SkinMapDeploy\SkinMapLocal-dist"
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\scripts\setup_vendor_engine.ps1 `
  -VendorEngineRoot "D:\SkinMapDeploy\Engine"
$env:SKINMAP_VENDOR_ENGINE_ROOT = "$env:LOCALAPPDATA\SkinMapLocal\VendorEngine"
```

脚本只创建目录联接，不修改厂家Engine。若目标位置已有非预期目录或联接，脚本会拒绝
覆盖。必须注意：当前 `setup_vendor_engine.ps1` 只检查 `XingerEngine.exe` 是否存在，
它不能证明 `_internal` 和模型完整。建立联接后追加执行最低静态检查：

```powershell
$Engine = "$env:LOCALAPPDATA\SkinMapLocal\VendorEngine"
$Required = @(
  "$Engine\XingerEngine.exe",
  "$Engine\_internal\skin_detect.py",
  "$Engine\_internal\models",
  "$Engine\_internal\mediapipe",
  "$Engine\_internal\torch",
  "$Engine\_internal\ultralytics",
  "$Engine\_internal\python310.dll",
  "$Engine\_internal\opencv_world3410.dll",
  "$Engine\_internal\mediapipe\python\opencv_world3410.dll"
)
$Missing = $Required | Where-Object { -not (Test-Path -LiteralPath $_) }
if ($Missing) { $Missing; throw "Vendor Engine is incomplete." }
```

静态检查通过后，仍必须让适配器通过厂家 `/test`，并用授权的真实9图/12图执行一次
Exact CLI冒烟。只有这两步也成功，才能记录“Engine可运行”。厂家Engine在本项目中应
保持只读，不注入、不拆包修改、不绕过授权。

## 7. 运行命令

### 7.1 单RGB CLI

```powershell
Set-Location "D:\SkinMapDeploy\SkinMapLocal-dist"
.\bin\skin_map_rgb.exe `
  --image "D:\SkinMapDeploy\private-input\phone.jpg" `
  --device-profile generic `
  --output "D:\SkinMapDeploy\private-results\rgb-job-001" `
  --root .
```

### 7.2 厂家Exact CLI

输入目录必须使用固定文件名：

```text
RGB_M.jpg RGB_L.jpg RGB_R.jpg
CP_M.jpg  CP_L.jpg  CP_R.jpg
365_M.jpg 365_L.jpg 365_R.jpg
PP_M.jpg  PP_L.jpg  PP_R.jpg       # 可选
```

每次任务使用一个不存在或空的输出目录，程序不会覆盖非空目录：

```powershell
Set-Location "D:\SkinMapDeploy\SkinMapLocal-dist"
.\bin\skin_map_instrument.exe `
  --input-dir "D:\SkinMapDeploy\private-input\scan-001" `
  --vendor-engine "$env:LOCALAPPDATA\SkinMapLocal\VendorEngine" `
  --output "D:\SkinMapDeploy\private-results\exact-job-001" `
  --root .
```

成功后优先打开输出目录的 `RESULT_INDEX.html`，不要把黑底或透明的raw overlay误认为
完整人像结果。

### 7.3 HTTP服务与健康检查

终端1：

```powershell
Set-Location "D:\SkinMapDeploy\SkinMapLocal-dist"
$env:SKINMAP_RUNTIME_DIR = "$env:LOCALAPPDATA\SkinMapLocal\Runtime"
.\scripts\run_service.ps1
#include <algorithm>
#include <array>
#include <chrono>
#include <cstdlib>
#include <filesystem>
#include <fstream>
#include <iostream>
#include <optional>
#include <string>

#include <nlohmann/json.hpp>

#include "skinmap/config.hpp"
#include "skinmap/error.hpp"
#include "skinmap/image_io.hpp"
#include "skinmap/skin_maps.hpp"
#include "skinmap/vendor_skin_adapter.hpp"

#ifdef _WIN32
#include <windows.h>
#endif

namespace {

struct Arguments {
  std::filesystem::path input_directory;
  std::filesystem::path vendor_engine;
  std::filesystem::path output;
  std::filesystem::path project_root;
};

#ifdef _WIN32
Arguments ParseArguments(int argc, wchar_t** argv) {
  Arguments result;
  for (int index = 1; index < argc; ++index) {
    const std::wstring option(argv[index]);
    if (option == L"--help" || option == L"-h") {
      std::cout << "skin_map_instrument --input-dir <9-image-directory> "
                   "--vendor-engine <Engine-directory-or-exe> --output <directory> "
                   "[--root <project>]\n";
      std::exit(0);
    }
    if (index + 1 >= argc) throw std::runtime_error("An option value is missing.");
    if (option == L"--input-dir") result.input_directory = argv[++index];
    else if (option == L"--vendor-engine") result.vendor_engine = argv[++index];
    else if (option == L"--output") result.output = argv[++index];
    else if (option == L"--root") result.project_root = argv[++index];
    else throw std::runtime_error("Unknown command-line option.");
  }
  return result;
}
#else
Arguments ParseArguments(int argc, char** argv) {
  Arguments result;
  for (int index = 1; index < argc; ++index) {
    const std::string option(argv[index]);
    if (option == "--help" || option == "-h") {
      std::cout << "skin_map_instrument --input-dir <9-image-directory> "
                   "--vendor-engine <Engine-directory-or-exe> --output <directory> "
                   "[--root <project>]\n";
      std::exit(0);
    }
    if (index + 1 >= argc) throw std::runtime_error("An option value is missing.");
    if (option == "--input-dir") result.input_directory = argv[++index];
    else if (option == "--vendor-engine") result.vendor_engine = argv[++index];
    else if (option == "--output") result.output = argv[++index];
    else if (option == "--root") result.project_root = argv[++index];
    else throw std::runtime_error("Unknown command-line option.");
  }
  return result;
}
#endif

bool IsProjectRoot(const std::filesystem::path& path) {
  return std::filesystem::is_regular_file(
      path / "assets/calibration/skin_map_v2.json");
}

std::optional<std::filesystem::path> TryFindProjectRoot(
    std::filesystem::path candidate) {
  candidate = std::filesystem::absolute(candidate);
  for (int depth = 0; depth < 6; ++depth) {
    if (IsProjectRoot(candidate)) return candidate;
    if (candidate == candidate.parent_path()) break;
    candidate = candidate.parent_path();
  }
  return std::nullopt;
}

std::filesystem::path FindProjectRoot(const std::filesystem::path& candidate) {
  if (const auto root = TryFindProjectRoot(candidate); root.has_value()) return *root;
#ifdef _WIN32
  std::wstring module(32768, L'\0');
  const DWORD length = GetModuleFileNameW(nullptr, module.data(),
                                          static_cast<DWORD>(module.size()));
  if (length > 0 && length < module.size()) {
    module.resize(length);
    if (const auto root =
            TryFindProjectRoot(std::filesystem::path(module).parent_path());
        root.has_value()) return *root;
  }
#endif
  throw std::runtime_error("Could not locate SkinMapLocal; pass --root.");
}

int Run(const Arguments& arguments) {
  if (arguments.input_directory.empty() || arguments.output.empty()) {
    throw std::runtime_error("Both --input-dir and --output are required.");
  }
  const auto input = std::filesystem::absolute(arguments.input_directory);
  if (!std::filesystem::is_directory(input)) {
    throw std::runtime_error("The instrument input directory does not exist.");
  }
  const auto root = arguments.project_root.empty()
                        ? FindProjectRoot(std::filesystem::current_path())
                        : FindProjectRoot(arguments.project_root);
  const auto output = std::filesystem::absolute(arguments.output);
  skinmap::PrepareEmptyOutputDirectory(output);

  const std::array<const char*, 9> required_names = {
      "RGB_M.jpg", "RGB_L.jpg", "RGB_R.jpg", "CP_M.jpg", "CP_L.jpg",
      "CP_R.jpg",  "365_M.jpg", "365_L.jpg", "365_R.jpg"};
  const std::array<const char*, 3> optional_pp_names = {
      "PP_M.jpg", "PP_L.jpg", "PP_R.jpg"};
  const auto nonce = std::chrono::steady_clock::now().time_since_epoch().count();
  const auto staging = std::filesystem::temp_directory_path() /
                       ("skinmap_instrument_" + std::to_string(nonce));
  const auto job = staging / "job";
  std::filesystem::create_directories(job / "input");
  std::filesystem::create_directories(job / "output");

  try {
    for (const char* name : required_names) {
      const auto source = input / name;
      if (!std::filesystem::is_regular_file(source)) {
        throw skinmap::Error("MISSING_MODALITY",
                             "The complete RGB, CP and 365 image set is required.",
                             422, {{"missing", {name}}});
      }
      std::filesystem::copy_file(source, job / "input" / name);
    }
    for (const char* name : optional_pp_names) {
      const auto source = input / name;
      if (std::filesystem::is_regular_file(source)) {
        std::filesystem::copy_file(source, job / "input" / name);
      }
    }

    skinmap::Config config = skinmap::Config::FromEnvironment(root);
    config.jobs_dir = staging;
    if (!arguments.vendor_engine.empty()) {
      const auto supplied = std::filesystem::absolute(arguments.vendor_engine);
      if (std::filesystem::is_directory(supplied)) {
        config.vendor_skin_engine_root = supplied;
        config.vendor_skin_exe_path = supplied / "XingerEngine.exe";
      } else {
        config.vendor_skin_exe_path = supplied;
        config.vendor_skin_engine_root = supplied.parent_path();
      }
    }
    const skinmap::PipelineResult result = skinmap::RunSkinMapPipeline(
        "00000000000000000000000000000000", "skin_instrument", job, config,
        [](int percent, const std::string& stage) {
          std::cout << percent << "% " << stage << '\n';
        });
    for (const auto& entry : std::filesystem::directory_iterator(job / "output")) {
      if (entry.is_regular_file()) {
        std::filesystem::copy_file(entry.path(), output / entry.path().filename(),
                                   std::filesystem::copy_options::overwrite_existing);
      }
    }
    nlohmann::json quality = result.quality;
    quality["entrypoint"] = "skin_map_instrument_cli";
    std::ofstream(output / "quality.json", std::ios::binary | std::ios::trunc)
        << quality.dump(2) << '\n';
    skinmap::StopOwnedVendorSkinProcess();
    std::error_code cleanup_error;
    std::filesystem::remove_all(staging, cleanup_error);
    std::cout << quality.dump(2) << '\n';
    return 0;
  } catch (...) {
    skinmap::StopOwnedVendorSkinProcess();
    std::error_code ignored;
    std::filesystem::remove_all(staging, ignored);
    throw;
  }
}

}  // namespace

#ifdef _WIN32
int wmain(int argc, wchar_t** argv) {
#else
int main(int argc, char** argv) {
#endif
  try {
    return Run(ParseArguments(argc, argv));
  } catch (const skinmap::Error& error) {
    std::cerr << error.ToJson().dump(2) << '\n';
    return 1;
  } catch (const std::exception& error) {
    std::cerr << "skin_map_instrument: " << error.what() << '\n';
    return 1;
  }
